[
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:0.1"], "en": "Buddhavamsa 9:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:0.2", "PA_bv_9:1.1"], "en": "The Lineage of Anomadassi Buddha \"After Sobhita, there was another...\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:1.2"], "en": "The Fully Awakened One, supreme among bipeds,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:1.3"], "en": "was Anomadassī of immeasurable fame,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:1.4"], "en": "radiant and difficult to surpass.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:2.1", "PA_bv_9:2.2"], "en": "Having thus severed all bonds and shattered the three realms of existence,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:2.3"], "en": "[he follows] the path that leads to no returning.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:2.4"], "en": "He taught gods and humans alike.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:3.1"], "en": "Like the ocean, he was unshakeable;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:3.2"], "en": "like a mountain, he was difficult to assail.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:3.3"], "en": "Like the infinite sky,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:3.4"], "en": "like a blossoming king of sāl trees—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:4.1"], "en": "by the mere sight of that Buddha, [one is purified].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:4.2"], "en": "Living beings are satisfied;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:4.3"], "en": "having heard the speech being uttered,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:4.4"], "en": "they attain the Deathless.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:5.1"], "en": "There was a realization of the Dhamma for him;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:5.2"], "en": "it then became prosperous and flourishing,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:5.3"], "en": "as hundreds of millions attained realization.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:5.4"], "en": "In the first teaching of the Dhamma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:6.1"], "en": "and thereafter during the realization [of the Truth],", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:6.2"], "en": "the rains of Dhamma poured down.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:6.3", "PA_bv_9:6.4"], "en": "Eighty koṭis attained direct realization during the second teaching of the Dhamma.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:7.1"], "en": "After that, as it was raining—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:7.2"], "en": "And while tormenting living beings,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:7.3", "PA_bv_9:7.4"], "en": "there occurred the third realization for seventy-eight koṭis.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:8.1", "PA_bv_9:8.2"], "en": "There were three assemblies of that Great Seer as well,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:8.3"], "en": "who had attained the power of direct knowledge.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:8.4"], "en": "Of those who had blossomed through liberation,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:9.1", "PA_bv_9:9.2"], "en": "there was then a gathering of one hundred and eighty thousand.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:9.3", "PA_bv_9:9.4", "PA_bv_9:10.1"], "en": "Of those seven hundred thousand who had abandoned pride and delusion, whose minds were peaceful and who were steadfast.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:10.2", "PA_bv_9:10.3"], "en": "There was a second meeting of those who were stainless, dustless,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:10.4"], "en": "peaceful, and steadfast.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:11.1", "PA_bv_9:11.2"], "en": "There was a third assembly of one hundred thousand [monks],", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:11.3"], "en": "who had attained the power of direct knowledge.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:11.4"], "en": "Of those ascetics who had attained Nibbāna.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:12.1"], "en": "At that time,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:12.2"], "en": "I was a yakkha of great psychic power;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:12.3"], "en": "He was the lord over many tens of millions of yakkhas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:12.4"], "en": "a sovereign in the realm of Vasavatti.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:13.1"], "en": "Even then, he [honored] that supreme Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:13.2"], "en": "Having approached the Great Sage,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:13.3", "PA_bv_9:13.4"], "en": "the Leader of the World together with his Saṅgha, I satisfied him with food and drink.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:14.1", "PA_bv_9:14.2"], "en": "Then that Sage of pure vision also prophesied to me:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:14.3"], "en": "\"In immeasurable aeons...\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:14.4"], "en": "\"This one will become a Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:15.1", "PA_bv_9:15.2"], "en": "Having exerted himself in striving... [and so forth].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:15.3"], "en": "\"We shall stand face to face with him.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:16.1"], "en": "Having heard her words as well,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:16.2"], "en": "he was joyful and his mind was filled with agitation.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:16.3", "PA_bv_9:16.4"], "en": "I resolved upon a further vow for the fulfillment of the ten perfections.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:17.1"], "en": "There was a city named Candavatī;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:17.2"], "en": "The kṣatriya was named Yasava;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:17.3", "PA_bv_9:17.4"], "en": "the mother of the Teacher Anomadassi was named Yasodharā.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:18.1", "PA_bv_9:18.2"], "en": "For ten thousand years he lived at home; his glory,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:18.3"], "en": "secondary glory, and prosperity increased.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:18.4"], "en": "There were three supreme palaces.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:19.1", "PA_bv_9:19.2"], "en": "Twenty-three thousand women were beautifully adorned.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:19.3"], "en": "That woman was named Sirimā,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:19.4"], "en": "and her son was named Upavaṇa.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:20.1"], "en": "Having seen four omens, [he departed].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:20.2"], "en": "He went forth from the palanquin;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:20.3"], "en": "for no fewer than ten months,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:20.4"], "en": "the Victor exerted himself in striving.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:21.1"], "en": "Being entreated by Brahmā,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:21.2"], "en": "the Great Sage Anomadassī,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:21.3"], "en": "the Great Hero, set the Wheel of Dhamma in motion.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:21.4"], "en": "In the Sudassana Garden,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:22.1", "PA_bv_9:22.2"], "en": "Nisabha and Anoma were his two chief disciples.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:22.3", "PA_bv_9:22.4"], "en": "Varuṇa was the attendant of the Teacher Anomadassi;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:23.1"], "en": "and there were Sundarī and Sumanā.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:23.2"], "en": "were his chief female disciples;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:23.3", "PA_bv_9:23.4"], "en": "the Bodhi tree of that Blessed One is called the *ajjuna*.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:24.1", "PA_bv_9:24.2"], "en": "Nandivaḍḍha and Sirivaḍḍha were the chief supporters;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:24.3"], "en": "Uppalā and Padumā as well.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:24.4"], "en": "They were his foremost attendants.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:25.1", "PA_bv_9:25.2"], "en": "The Great Sage rose up to a height of fifty-eight ratanas.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:25.3", "PA_bv_9:25.4"], "en": "His radiance streams forth like the risen sun with its hundred rays.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:26.1"], "en": "For a hundred thousand years,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:26.2", "PA_bv_9:26.3"], "en": "As long as his life remained,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:26.4"], "en": "for that long he stayed and delivered many people.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:27.1", "PA_bv_9:27.2"], "en": "The word of the Teacher has fully blossomed through those Arhats who are such-like,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:27.3"], "en": "free from passion, and stainless.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:27.4"], "en": "He praised the teaching of the Conqueror.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:28.1"], "en": "And that Teacher of immeasurable fame—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:28.2"], "en": "those ages were beyond compare.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:28.3"], "en": "All that has vanished;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:28.4"], "en": "are not all conditioned things empty?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:29.1"], "en": "The Jina, the Teacher Anomadassī—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:29.2"], "en": "He attained Nibbāna in the Dhamma-grove;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:29.3"], "en": "right there stands his Jina-stūpa,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:29.4"], "en": "twenty-five cubits in height.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_9:30.1"], "en": "The lineage of the Blessed One Anomadassi is the seventh.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"}
]
